{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2023-06-24 07:05:00', 'title': 'DDB NAMED NETWORK OF THE YEAR AT THE 2023 CANNES LIONS INTERNATIONAL FESTIVAL OF CREATIVITY', 'text': "DDB WORLDWIDE'S HOLDING COMPANY OMNICOM ALSO NAMED CREATIVE COMPANY OF THE YEAR\xa0 NEW YORK , JUNE 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CANNES LIONS INTERNATIONAL FESTIVAL OF CREATIVITY HAS NAMED DDB WORLDWIDE NETWORK OF THE YEAR FOR 2023. DDB TAKES TOP HONORS AFTER MOVING UP TWO SPOTS IN THE RANKING, COMPARED TO 2022 AND UP FIVE SPOTS FROM 2021."}